                &lt;p&gt;Nature, Published online: 05 October 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03135-7"&gt;doi:10.1038/d41586-026-03135-7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Twenty-five years after the US anthrax attacks, fears around AI are distracting people from seeing what’s needed to stay safe: a strong, regulated life-sciences sector.</content:encoded>
