                &lt;p&gt;Nature, Published online: 01 October 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03141-9"&gt;doi:10.1038/d41586-026-03141-9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Coloured stripes across the sky and a crab caught in jellyfish tentacles are among this month’s sharpest science shots. Plus, a ‘speech clock’ could determine how fast you’re ageing and how invasive plant species are displacing farmers in Africa.</content:encoded>
